  "style": {
    "id": "art-deco",
    "name": "Art Deco",
    "description": "Machine-age Art Deco in polished brass and gold, black lacquer, cream marble and jade under a bright cream-to-teal sky: bronze elevator doors with an inlaid fan slide apart, a gold sunburst fans open ray by ray like a folding fan, a stepped ziggurat skyscraper telescopes up terrace by terrace (vertical fluting, glowing frosted-glass window bays, chevron parapets, a spire extending last) while two searchlights sweep in mirror image, crown ornaments (chevrons, scallop fans, sunray fans, stepped keystone frames, finials) click into place in mirrored pairs, and a framed title panel unfolds from the centre line. The signature is symmetric unfolding and stepped ascent: every element is mirrored about one centre line and grows in terraces; a THREE-free planner (deco.js) times every unfold and the stepped rising chords (one per tier), ray notes and ornament clicks come from the same plan.",
